::: mermaid
sequenceDiagram
PROD ->>Business Analysis: User report some Application Issue
PROD ->>Business Analysis: Ticketing Tool or Services Now
PROD ->> Business Analysis: Collect the necessary repro steps
PROD ->> Business Analysis: Create a repro steps document
Business Analysis->> Main/UAT: Try re-creating the scenario in UAT instance
Business Analysis->> Main/UAT: Classify the bug Type (Technical / Functional / Data)
Business Analysis->> Main/UAT: [Technical] / [Functional] / [Data] / [Microsoft])
Main/UAT->> DevOps: Create the Bug Work Item
Main/UAT->> DevOps: Attach the require document
Main/UAT->> DevOps: Assignee a relevant resource
Main/UAT->> DevOps: If Technical?
DevOps->> Dev: Review the Requirement
DevOps->> Dev: Find the cause(RCA)
DevOps->> Dev: Resolve the Issue
Dev->> Business Analysis: Review the Solution with Business Analysis
Dev->> Test: Move the solution 
Dev->> Test: Validate the Fix
DevOps->> Main/UAT: Create a Deployable Package
DevOps->> Main/UAT: Deliver the code to Customer for Unit Testing
Loop Validate the Fix
Main/UAT->> Main/UAT: Approve or Reject by Customer 
End
Test->> Main/UAT: On Success
Main/UAT -->> PROD: Schedule the code Delivery
    Main/UAT-->>PROD: Plan for PROD Release
    Main/UAT-->>PROD: Release Date?
    Main/UAT-->>PROD: Inform the Key business users/Audience
    Main/UAT-->>PROD: Schedule the code Promotion/Delivery 
:::
